---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="md:row-span-5 lg:row-span-3" title="About me">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 h-full">
    <div class="text-[12px] font-light">
      <p class="leading-snug">
        Hi, I'm Sayeem, a Computer Science graduate from Toronto Metropolitan University. I build and work on data infrastructure.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-1 mb-0.5 text-[12px]">What I've been working with:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[12px] leading-snug space-y-0">
        <li>Python, SQL, PySpark</li>
        <li>dbt, Airflow, Databricks</li>
        <li>BigQuery, Snowflake, AWS & GCP</li>
        <li>CI/CD, Docker, Power BI & Looker Studio</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p class="text-[12px] font-light leading-snug mt-0.5">
      Off the laptop: soccer, early-morning fishing, strength training, building things with wood, and making music.
      Currently reading The Sisters Brothers by Patrick deWitt.
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>